window.products.push({"id":992004,"name":"BESTWYA Smart Alarm Clock,Talking Clock with 3 Alarms, Optional Weekday Alarm, Intelligent Noctilucent & Snooze Function, Month Date & Temperature Dis","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LCrP+zm8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Q: I need an alarm clock I can set up to alert me at 6 am, 2 pm and 10 pm. Can you set an alarm for Mon-Wed-Fri only ? Can this clock do this without having to reset each time the alarm goes off? A: Yes.3 group of clock.5 workday Mode, 6 days Mode, 7 days Mode for you to choose. And time announcing function. very useful functions, worth every penny.  Q: Some buyer reflect it cannot show the accurate time? A: Just like other digital clocks of the same price, it usually go faster or slower one minute per week. It is inevitable. Only expensive Swiss clocks (Very small error) or atomic clocks can avoid this error. If you mind this, you can choose the Swiss clocks or atomic clocks. We have tested 1 clock, only 2 minutes slower than the standard time in about a month.  Q: Can we hang it on the wall? A: No.It can be placed on a table or bed, very good decoration for offices, classrooms, and bedrooms.  Q: Does it have cord? A: Only battery! Carbon batteries are recommended. High-capacity alkaline or rechargeable batteries may damage the clock.  Q: Can we see the screen in the dark? A: Yes. When we turn on the sensor button, we can read the calendar and temperature at about 4 ft and read the time at about 8 ft. Press the light key above, we can read the screen more clearly.  Q:What should we do if we have any question about your product? A:We have made new product instrution with more detailed picture, it will help you to use the clock. We have checked every clock before sending it to Amazon warehouse. If you still find problem about our product, feel free to contact us ,and we will glad to help you.   We are responsible seller, and want our dear buyer to know the details of our product before making a order.  Package include: 1 x Digital Alarm Clock 1 x User Manual 3 x AAA Batteries","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LCrP+zm8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BESTWYA","source_asin":"B07H4RM7X6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-992004","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H4RM7X6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H4RM7X6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
