window.products.push({"id":992134,"name":"Primitives by Kathy 103598 Pet Memorial Photo Frame, 6\" x 6\", You were My Favorite Hello and My Hardest Goodbye","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.14,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pv1u5h7EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Rustic-inspired pet memorial photo frame with sentiment and pawprint and heart design; fits a 5 x 3-inch photo. CAREFULLY BUY ONLY FROM or trusted partners to authentic Primitives By Kathy gifts and decor with premium quality printing, stitching, and fabrics. In 1997, Kathy made her first \"primitive candle box\" by hand, taking care into each detail from the sanded edges to the type of ribbon tied on the wire handles, each was a work of passion. As Primitives by Kathy grows, the company works to give back, starting with an initial relationship with Goodwill Services and expanding into several more charitable causes held both by the company and those the company supports on behalf of their employees. They are constantly inspired by the people, places and things around us. Kathy travels the world to pull inspiration first hand from cultures around the globe. Look for all of Primitives by Kathy for inspirational, fun, sarcastic, and heart-warming gifts and home decor. You'll want to have one for yourself and another for someone you care about.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pv1u5h7EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Primitives by Kathy","source_asin":"B088W58GF9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-992134","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088W58GF9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088W58GF9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":992135,"name":"Aviation Decor - Set of FOUR (8\"x10\") Biplanes Patent Wall Art Prints - Aviator Gift Ideas - Pilot Themed Home Decorations - Boys Room Man Cave Living","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718I1BvSixS._AC_SL1222_.jpg","description":"GREAT GIFT FOR AVIATION LOVERS: Get a patent print set today for the pilot or aviation lover that you know or why not get a set for yourself! They make a unique gifts that spark interesting conversations. Antique reproduction patent prints are beautiful, interesting and educational. PRINT SET SIZE: Set of FOUR 8\"x10\" Biplane Art Prints. MADE IN USA: This compact 8”x10” size print is versatile and easy to hang. You can hang them as a group or individually. Please NOTE: colors may appear slightly different to each user due to individual monitor settings. PRINTS COME UNFRAMED: This allows you the freedom to choose your favorite frames and mat combination. These prints mount quickly and easily into ready to hang 8”x10” frames or 11”x14” with an 8”x10” mat. You can also clip them to a string, mount on foamcore or stick to the wall with 3m removable tape. EASY-TO-ORDER – QUICK SHIPPING: Amazon fulfills and ships our art prints directly to you. This makes shipping fast and returns are easy. Your prints will be shipped flat in a cardboard envelope for 8x10 prints.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718I1BvSixS._AC_SL1222_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ArtCantHurtU","source_asin":"B07T5L1Q9Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-992135","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07T5L1Q9Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07T5L1Q9Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
