window.products.push({"id":992221,"name":"Tea Ball Infuser Set with 1 Multi-Cup Large Steeper, 2 Single-Cup Infusers for Loose Leaf, Stainless Steel, Fine Mesh - Mulling Spice Ball Set - Tea A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Z3O4MkCrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"REFINE YOUR TEA TIME: Elevate your favorite loose tea experience with this Stainless Steel Tea Infuser Set from Skvely! Complete with 1 large tea infuser, 2 single-cup tea infusers, matching drip trays, and a clip-style scoop that are all designed with beauty and excellence, you will be able to enjoy an exceptional cup of tea for any occasion. ELEGANCE AND QUALITY: Never settle for ordinary as you enjoy the perfect sip of tea. Our large tea balls for loose tea are made with stunning stainless steel and designed with fine mesh holes for debris-free brewing. Each loose tea steeper ball includes a translucent, black glass lid to add a touch of sophistication to any cup of tea. EXCEEDS YOUR TEA TIME NEEDS: Whether you’re enjoying a single cup or brewing tea for a party, with our large tea infusers for loose tea, you will always enjoy the perfect brew. There is one large tea ball that can be used to make a pot of tea or two small infuser tea balls for individual servings. You can even use these tea balls to mull spices! EXCEPTIONAL TEA BREWING: This loose tea infuser ball set is designed to make brewing tea simple. Each fine mesh tea infuser has a screw-on lid with a threaded connection that is easy to open and close. Plus, these brewing accessories have long, hook-free weighted chains to easily lift the ball infuser from your cup without burning your fingers. PERFECT FOR EVERY TEA LOVER: With a unique, extraordinary design and amazing craftsmanship, these fine tea infusers for loose tea make an unbeatable gift for any tea lover. Complete with a gift box that can be used for storage, this loose tea ball infuser set is the perfect present for birthdays, anniversaries, or any special occasion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Z3O4MkCrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"skvely","source_asin":"B086HPBM8M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-992221","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086HPBM8M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086HPBM8M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
