window.products.push({"id":992241,"name":"LIMORELI LED Mirror, Oblong Frameless Wall Mounted Mirror, Anti-Fog and Explosion-Proof, Large Vertical or Horizontal Makeup Mirror for Vanity Room, 3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":197.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51a3LJytpkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[LED Mirror for Bathroom] The Limoreli LED mirror is a wall mounted mirror that provides light colors options in the temperature's 3000K, 4200K and 6000K for your bathroom. [Easy to use and durable] LED lifetime: It also offers a lifetime of over 50000 hours which means if you use the lights for 3 hours a day, the lights will last for about 45 years. Long press to adjust the colors of the light. [Copper-Free Stylish Silver Mirror] The mirror is constructed copper free that is three times more resistant to corrosion than traditional silver mirrors. It is anti-oxidant, blackening and scratch resistant which is also environmentally friendly suitable for long-term use. This oblong, wall mount mirror is built with a modern style offering a classier and more elegant décor for your bathroom or your bedroom. [Anti-Fog Feature] The Limoreli mirror offers an anti-fog film to avoid condensation of water and mist to achieve defogging effect. The defogging function helps retain a clear reflection in the mirror even if you take steamy showers. [Waterproof and Safe] The Limoreli LED mirror has IP44 waterproof rating that is environment friendly making it ideal for over the sink usage. It is also ETL listed which ensures that it is safe to use in a wet bathroom. The package has passed different drop, pressure and impact tests to ensure safe transportation. [Easy Installation and Ideal for Gifting] The mirror is easy to install with the provided screw mount and can be installed vertically or horizontally depending on your preference making it an ideal mirror for bathroom, bedroom, makeup room and living room. It is also a suitable option as a gift to a friend or family accounting for various occasions such as moving to a different place or redoing their house. [Hassle-free experience] We provide 18 months product warranty service and friendly customer service, if you encounter problems, please contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51a3LJytpkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIMORELI","source_asin":"B09TKF8SJR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-992241","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TKF8SJR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TKF8SJR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
