window.products.push({"id":992332,"name":"Bundaloo Side Sofa Table | Home Decor & Living Room Stand for Coffee & Snacks | Food Tray, Laptop, Magazine, Book & Holder for Bedroom | Couch End Tab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mFG02isML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Is your snacking ruining your otherwise perfect sofa? TV and movie nights are never complete without popcorn, chips and an assortment of beverages around. The problem is, balancing these items on your lap is difficult. And sometimes, they end up in messes and stains on your sofa. This is especially true with kids around the house. They frequently try to reach for their food, toys and gadgets all at once, then end up dropping everything on the floor. If only there’s a table within reach so that your children won’t have to keep getting up from their seat. With our Bundaloo Rustic Tree Leaf Side Sofa Table, you can prevent spills and crumbs from messing up your beautiful couch! We designed this side table to provide you with a relaxing evening at the end of a tiring workday, or a fun weekend with your family. It is the perfect excuse to be a couch potato. Just slide the table under your sofa, and everything you need is just one grab away. When not being used as a tray holder, this table can hold and display your books, flower pots and candles. You can also convert it into a laptop holder for when you decide to work in front of the television. Meanwhile, the bottom part can serve as a storage for magazines, newspapers, plastic containers and baskets. With a contemporary and chic design, our end table blends well with any modern décor. Accentuate it with a doily or linen, or keep it simple by not placing anything on it at all. The table stands as a lovely furniture on its own. Here are the dimensions of our Rustic Tree Leaf side table when fully assembled: ✅ Length: 12 inches ✅ Width: 8 ¼ inches ✅ Height: 21 inches Bundaloo is here for you! Your backed by a 6 month Warranty Keep your essentials within arm’s reach. Add Bundaloo Rustic Tree Leaf Side Sofa Table to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mFG02isML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bundaloo","source_asin":"B07PGX5F6P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-992332","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PGX5F6P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PGX5F6P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":992333,"name":"PGbureau The Lion King Inspired Watercolor Art Print Wall Poster Home Decor Illustration - 8x10 Painting Paper Print P47","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OjZwVRj1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Kids as well as adults usually adore The Lion King animation film, so it’s a good idea to have some memorabilia at home connected to the movie. This Lion King poster may be exactly what you need – for yourself or maybe as a gift to a fan of this animation movie. How to handle the poster? It doesn’t require any special care: the paper is thick enough not to get torn at the corners. It means you can use the poster the way we sell it – without any frames, just by itself. The measures of this poster are 8x10”, it’s almost the size of a standard letter page. A thumbtack or two will be enough to keep it in place for good. This Lion King print will look perfect on the wall or on the special board where you collect other beautiful posters. We’re sure that this one will become the gem of any collection!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OjZwVRj1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PGbureau","source_asin":"B077CQW1QM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-992333","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077CQW1QM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077CQW1QM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
