window.products.push({"id":992398,"name":"Original Otto Wilde Grillers Pizza Set, Otto's Pizza Stone and Oak Pizza Paddle, certified & food-safe Cordierite Pizza Stone 12.8 x 10.4 in","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31-gD6e2lqL._AC_.jpg","description":"Since four years Otto Wilde Grillers is a young family business led by Otto and his three children Julia, Alex and Nils. Our vision was to create a high quality grill that offers highest steak indulgence and enough space for all common cuts while being convenient to clean. The Otto 1500°F Steak Grill is the result of our first mission “the perfect steak”. What makes Otto's Steak Grill so special? The Otto 1500°F Steak Grill is unlike any grill you’ve ever seen. Its unique and efficient rectangular, front-loading open design accommodates dual OverFire radiant burners which are housed in the top of the grill. It is these OverFire radiant burners that allow the grill to get to 1500°F, a temperature they can achieve in just three minutes. These temperatures create a wonderful crust on your steak, a crust that literally seals in the moisture and flavor, also called the Maillard Effect. Otto's Pizza Set With Otto's Pizza Set you bring original Italian stone oven pizza quality to your home. The stone is made of food-safe Cordierite. Due to its high heat resistance and its ability to withstand strong temperature fluctuations, this is the optimal material to use on Otto's high-temperature grill. Thanks to the practical dimensions of 12.8 x 10.4 in, the pizza stone fits wonderfully in your Otto Steak Grill and is big enough for a large pizza. Otto's pizza peel is made of high-quality oak wood and due to its tailor-made size, the peel is an optimal helper for baking a pizza in Otto's Steak Grill. The Peel makes the preparation of pizza and tarte flambée or other baking specialties child's play. Together, the pizza peel and pizza stone deliver Italian pizza in no time! Details: Material Pizza Stone: Cordierite Material Pizza Stone: Cordierite Size Pizza Stone: 12.8 x 10.4 in Size Pizza Stone: 12.8 x 10.4 in Material Pizza Peel: Oak Material Pizza Peel: Oak Scope of delivery: Otto's Pizza Stone Otto's Pizza Stone Otto’s Pizza Peel Otto’s Pizza Peel","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31-gD6e2lqL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Otto Wilde","source_asin":"B06WLMNX66","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-992398","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06WLMNX66","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06WLMNX66","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
