window.products.push({"id":992522,"name":"Baulia TO809 Digital Countertop Toaster Oven, 12 Inch Pizza 33 Liter Compact Convection Oven | Stainless Steel Even Heat Technology | 9 Pre-programmed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7112SERW8CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Get cooking in your vacation apartment, dorm room kitchen or small apartment with this digital toaster oven! not everyone is lucky enough to have an oven that fits an entire turkey! although no need to feel left out, as People only roast a turkey once a year anyway. or how about some crispy roast potatoes as a side dish with the steaks! general features: ➤ extra-spacious interior - this countertop oven is designed to fit 2 x 12-inch pizzas, casserole dishes, full size cakes, whole chickens, and more. ➤ adjustable racks – if you want to crisp things up, place the food right under the broiler. you can change the oven tray to high or low positions depending on if you want to just warm things up or cook different foods. ➤ 120-minute timer – with a digital timer, you will never burn your food. Set It for jobs like toasting, roasting or baking. bake, broil, toast, bagel, pizza, frozen snacks, potatoes, cookies. Everything will be done to perfection. ➤ nonstick oven – the interior is made with non-stick surface so cleanup is fast and easy. ✔ 33 liter ✔ Stainless Steel>✔ 1 year replacement . What's Included? ✔ 12-Inch non-stick multipurpose pan. ✔ 12-Inch broiling rack. ✔ cooling rack. ✔ non-stick drip tray.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7112SERW8CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baulia","source_asin":"B07D9RG8HP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-992522","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D9RG8HP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D9RG8HP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
