window.products.push({"id":992622,"name":"Hallmark Keepsake 2017 Symbols of The Season Premium Mini Blown Glass Christmas Ornaments, Set of 5","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91XJFLstsEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add a little beauty to your tree with this set of blown glass ornaments, featuring five symbols of the season: bell, Santa, Christmas tree, snowman and candy cane. Together, they'll look charming on a miniature tree. Separately, they'll make welcome hostess gifts. Festive and collectible, Hallmark Keepsake Ornaments come ready to give in a seasonal holiday gift box. The box can also be used for ornament storage. Set of 5 miniature Christmas tree ornaments. Santa: 1.75\" W x 2.4\" H x 1.6 D; Candy Cane: 1.3\" W x 2.4\" H x 0.7” D; Tree: 1.6\" W x 2.5\" H x 1.6” D; Bell: 1.7\" W x 2.4\" W x 1.7” D; Snowman: 1.6\" W x 2.4\" H x 1.25\" D. Set comes in a 5 x 5 x 5 gift box. Ornaments are made of glass. Designed by Ruth Donikowski. Each piece includes one 2017 Symbols of the Season Premium Mini Blown Glass Christmas Ornaments, Set of 5 in a gift-ready box. From preserving precious memories to commemorating special milestones, there's a Keepsake Ornament for everyone on your list. Hallmark has been your family-owned creator of greeting cards, gifts, gift wrap and more for over 100 years. We take deep pride in helping individuals connect in just the right way. This Hallmark original Keepsake Ornament features unparalleled artistry and exceptional detail. The ornament is lead-free and made for years of celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91XJFLstsEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hallmark","source_asin":"B01ND1KO6M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-992622","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01ND1KO6M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01ND1KO6M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
