window.products.push({"id":992737,"name":"Home Reed Diffuser-Home Fragrance Bouquet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Bsg3p295S._AC_.jpg","description":"Add a plus of well-being in your environments and decorations, a good aroma will delight any time and space, the environmental aromatization has become a standard and a key element if you want to transform your home or workplace into the most pleasant. Your visits will greatly flatter you to that detail. Human beings remember up to 35% of what smells against 5% of what they see, the sense of smell is the most developed and is directly related to emotions. Live in pleasant environments that believe in your brain positive memories, this will be reflected in your mood and performance. THE MIKADO MAR DE AROMAS AMBIENTS with their modern design, are the most decorative and natural way to perfume any stay of your home or office. They are a very successful and elegant gift for all ages and occasions: weddings, openings, birthdays, holidays, Christmas, company gifts, Father's Day, Mother's Day, clients and hosts. They do not consume any energy and do not pollute. Very easy to use, just flip the wands every day to get a constant and pleasant aromatization. If you want more intensity, turn the wands more often. We have selected our best fragrances creating for you the SEA COLLECTION OF AROMAS in which you can enjoy the BOUQUET fragrance that will make any occasion special thanks to its fine and elegant floral citrus notes. The WOOD air freshener with its woody notes will evoke moments of well-being, comfort and warmth. The CITRUS aroma has a positive effect on those who perceive it, it is fresh and very pleasant. Long duration: approximately 8 months of aromatic environment in your home or workplace. Contents: glass bottle with 100 ml aroma + 8 bamboo wands + 1 bamboo sphere. Bamboo throughout its surface will allow the essences to rise by capillary by evaporating them and distributing them through the environment enhancing their intensity.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Bsg3p295S._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAR DE AROMAS","source_asin":"B08FXVSS4W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-992737","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FXVSS4W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FXVSS4W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
