window.products.push({"id":992908,"name":"Swiss Republic 100% Cotton 8 Piece Towel Set (Dark Green); 2 Bath Towels, 2 Hand Towels and 4 Washcloths, Machine Washable, Super Soft, Quick Dry, Dou","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/914NJsbTWHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With Swiss Republic Experience spa-like pampering at home with this luxurious bath towel by Swiss Republic. The swiss republic bath towel provides ample coverage, and the high quality 600 GSM fibers provide great absorbency and strength. Leave the neatly folded towels out for visitors to help create a welcoming guest room, or hang the towels in a master bath for opulent everyday use. The swiss republic bath towel also makes a thoughtful gift idea for newlyweds, new home owners, or anyone in need of lavish luxury. Machine Washable Toss the towels into the washing machine and then into the dryer for convenient, hassle-free home care and clean, fluffy results every time. With each wash and dry, the towels will continue to get even softer. Soft, Absorbent, 100% Cotton, the swiss republic bath towel not only feels exceptionally soft against the skin, but it also soaks up water quickly, whether drying your face and hands or drying off after stepping out of the shower or a hot, soothing bubble bath. The superior length and strength of the cotton fibers also ensures durability and reduces the buildup of pile and lint, which helps keep the towels fresh and fabulous, year after year. Variety of Colors The swiss republic bath towel comes in a choice of pleasing colours--from Blue, Green, Light Brown, Dark Brown, Pink, and Grey. Stay with one color theme or mix and match to suit your mood. The set blends well with almost any existing home linens and surrounding decor. Invite Swiss Republic products into your home for their form and function, and experience their style, craftsmanship, and value. We travel the world to find the best materials and designs for Swiss Republic products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/914NJsbTWHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Swiss Republic","source_asin":"B078WSD81M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-992908","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078WSD81M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078WSD81M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
